\title{Nomad (2022)}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-10-09}

\p{
    Nomad is (was) a cross-chain bridge protocol. In August 2022, [more than 500 hacker addresses
    exploited a bug](https://x.com/samczsun/status/1554252024723546112) introduced by a faulty
    upgrade to one of the Nomad smart contracts. The upgrade incorrectly added the null address
    (\code{0x000...000}) as a trusted root, which turned off a key safety check, allowing anyone to
    withdraw arbitrary amounts of funds from the Nomad contract to their wallet by calling the
    contract with a particular payload. The
    [attack](https://etherscan.io/tx/0xa5fe9d044e4f3e5aa5bc4c0709333cd2190cba0f4e7f16bcf73f49f83e4a5460)
    resulted in 190 million USD in lost funds.
}